msgid "Instalar driver propietario NVIDIA (recomendado para mejor rendimiento)"
msgstr "Install proprietary NVIDIA driver (recommended for better performance)"

msgid "✦  Abrir Open WebUI"
msgstr "✦  Open Open WebUI"

msgid "⬇  Instalar Rising IA"
msgstr "⬇  Install Rising IA"

msgid "RISING IA"
msgstr "RISING IA"

msgid ""
"Tu asistente de IA\n"
"local para RisingOS."
msgstr ""
"Your local AI\n"
"assistant for RisingOS."

msgid ""
"Rising IA instala y configura automáticamente Ollama, el modelo que elijas y "
"Open WebUI. Todo corre en tu máquina, sin internet, sin suscripciones."
msgstr ""
"Rising IA automatically installs and configures Ollama, the model you "
"choose, and Open WebUI. Everything runs on your machine, without internet, "
"without subscriptions."

msgid "Stack de Rising IA"
msgstr "Rising IA stack"

msgid "Interfaz de chat"
msgstr "Chat interface"

msgid "Motor de inferencia"
msgstr "Inference engine"

msgid "Modelo elegido"
msgstr "Chosen model"

msgid "Modelo de lenguaje"
msgstr "Language model"

msgid "Contenedor Open WebUI"
msgstr "Open WebUI container"

msgid "Preparando instalación..."
msgstr "Preparing installation..."

msgid "INSTALANDO"
msgstr "INSTALLING"

msgid ""
"Instalando\n"
"Rising IA..."
msgstr ""
"Installing\n"
"Rising IA..."

msgid ""
"Esto puede tardar varios minutos dependiendo de tu conexión. No cierres esta "
"ventana."
msgstr ""
"This can take several minutes depending on your connection. Don't close "
"this window."

msgid "● Salida en tiempo real"
msgstr "● Live output"

msgid "el modelo elegido"
msgstr "the chosen model"

msgid "INSTALACIÓN COMPLETA"
msgstr "INSTALLATION COMPLETE"

msgid ""
"¡Rising IA está\n"
"lista para usar!"
msgstr ""
"Rising IA is\n"
"ready to use!"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Ollama, {models} y Open WebUI están instalados y corriendo en tu máquina. "
"Hacé clic para abrir la interfaz de chat en tu navegador."
msgstr ""
"Ollama, {models}, and Open WebUI are installed and running on your machine. "
"Click to open the chat interface in your browser."

msgid "✦  Abrir Open WebUI en el navegador"
msgstr "✦  Open Open WebUI in the browser"

msgid "ERROR DE INSTALACIÓN"
msgstr "INSTALLATION ERROR"

msgid ""
"Algo salió\n"
"mal."
msgstr ""
"Something went\n"
"wrong."

msgid ""
"Ocurrió un error durante la instalación. Revisá el log para más detalles. "
"Podés intentarlo de nuevo cuando quieras."
msgstr ""
"An error occurred during installation. Check the log for details. You can "
"try again whenever you want."

msgid "Reintentar"
msgstr "Retry"

msgid "Cerrar"
msgstr "Close"

msgid "Instalaste el driver NVIDIA — hace falta reiniciar para que se active."
msgstr "You installed the NVIDIA driver — a restart is needed to activate it."

msgid "⟳  Reiniciar ahora"
msgstr "⟳  Restart now"

msgid "Rising IA"
msgstr "Rising IA"

